 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "There was a wedding in Cana town",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The music playing all around",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the wine ran out before the night",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And Mary said, they have no more wine",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do whatever he tells you, do whatever he says",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Fill the jars with water, fill them to the brim",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Oh, the best wine is now",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He kept the best for now",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Water into wine, his glory shine",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The best wine is now",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Six stone jars along the wall",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The servants filled them one and all",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Draw it out and take it to the master of the feast",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He tasted and he said, you kept the best wine for last",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Everybody serves the good wine first",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But you kept the good wine until now",
